  "query": "-- The library file row a project-scoped delete locks.\n--\n-- The group is part of the lock, so a delete of another project never locks\n-- (and never deletes) a file it does not own.\nSELECT\n    id,\n    group_id,\n    storage_rel_path,\n    storage_object_id,\n    source_released_at,\n    sha256\nFROM context69.library_files\nWHERE id = $1\n  AND group_id = $2\nFOR UPDATE\n",
